width=\"110\"></font></a></p>\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><a href=\"/site/skill/uo_knowhow_moon/\"><font face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"20\" src=\"/img/posts/site/skill/images/left_menu/k_moon.gif\" width=\"110\"></font></a></p>\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><a href=\"/site/skill/uo_knowhow_rare/\"><font face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"20\" src=\"/img/posts/site/skill/images/left_menu/k_r.gif\" width=\"110\"></font></a></p>\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><a href=\"/site/skill/uo_knowhow_fame/\"><font face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"20\" src=\"/img/posts/site/skill/images/left_menu/k_f.gif\" width=\"110\"></font></a></p>\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><a href=\"/site/skill/uo_knowhow_runebook/\"><font face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"20\" src=\"/img/posts/site/skill/images/left_menu/k_rune.gif\" width=\"110\"></font></a></p>\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><a href=\"/site/skill/uo_knowhow_secret/\"><font face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"20\" src=\"/img/posts/site/skill/images/left_menu/k_s.gif\" width=\"110\"></font></a></p>\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><a href=\"/site/skill/uo_knowhow_mw/\"><font face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"20\" src=\"/img/posts/site/skill/images/left_menu/k_m.gif\" width=\"110\"></font></a></p>\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><a href=\"/site/skill/uo_knowhow_uosu/\"><font face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"20\" src=\"/img/posts/site/skill/images/left_menu/k_u.gif\" width=\"110\"></font></a></p>\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><a href=\"/site/skill/uo_knowhow_mirc/\"><font face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"20\" src=\"/img/posts/site/skill/images/left_menu/k_mirc.gif\" width=\"110\"></font></a></p>\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><a href=\"/site/skill/uo_knowhow_uoa/\"><font face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\"><img border=\"0\" data-original-src=\"http://forg.co.kr:80/skill/images/left_menu/k_uoa.gif\" data-recovery=\"missing\" height=\"20\" src=\"/img/placeholder/missing-slot.svg\" style=\"aspect-ratio:110/20\" width=\"110\"></font></a></p>\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><a href=\"/site/skill/uo_knowhow_uoam/\"><font face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"20\" src=\"/img/posts/site/skill/images/left_menu/k_uoam.gif\" width=\"110\"></font></a></p>\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"5\" src=\"/img/posts/site/skill/images/left_menu/k_line.gif\" width=\"110\"></font></p>\n</td>\n<td height=\"10\" width=\"627\"><p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\">&nbsp;</font></p></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td height=\"20\" width=\"627\"><p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\"><b>&nbsp;<a href=\"/site/skill/uo_knowhow_secret/\"><font color=\"black\" face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\">대륙의비밀장소</font></a>/<a href=\"/site/skill/uo_knowhow_secret_1/\"><font color=\"black\" face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\">던전의비밀장소</font></a></b></font></p></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td height=\"39\" width=\"630\"><p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\">&nbsp;</font></p>\n<table align=\"center\" border=\"\" width=\"60%\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td colspan=\"2\" width=\"606\"> <p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font color=\"#333333\" face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\"><b>파이어던전</b></font></p></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"479\"><p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\"><img border=\"0\" data-original-src=\"http://forg.co.kr:80/skill/images/uotip/hidden/d_1.gif\" data-recovery=\"missing\" height=\"275\" src=\"/img/placeholder/missing-slot.svg\" style=\"aspect-ratio:300/275\" width=\"300\"></font></p></td>\n<td width=\"479\"><p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\"><img border=\"0\" data-original-src=\"http://forg.co.kr:80/skill/images/uotip/hidden/d_2.gif\" data-recovery=\"missing\" height=\"275\" src=\"/img/placeholder/missing-slot.svg\" style=\"aspect-ratio:300/275\" width=\"300\"></font></p></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"479\">\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font color=\"#636363\" face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\">파이어던전에서 \n                            위에보이는장소에서</font></p>\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font color=\"#636363\" face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\">판타그램을 밟으시면 \n                            오른쪽 화면으로</font></p>\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font color=\"#636363\" face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\">이동됩니다.</font></p>\n</td>\n<td width=\"479\">\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font color=\"#636363\" face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\">내려오는 순간 \n                            불기둥이 솟구치는</font></p>\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font color=\"#636363\" face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\">장면을 보실 수 \n                            있습니다.</font></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\">&nbsp;</font></p>\n<table align=\"center\" border=\"\" width=\"60%\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td colspan=\"2\" width=\"606\"> <p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font color=\"#333333\" face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\"><b>디싯던전과아이스던전</b></font></p></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"479\"><p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\"><img border=\"0\" data-original-src=\"http://forg.co.kr:80/skill/images/uotip/hidden/d_4.gif\" data-recovery=\"missing\" height=\"275\" src=\"/img/placeholder/missing-slot.svg\" style=\"aspect-ratio:300/275\" width=\"300\"></font></p></td>\n<td width=\"479\"><p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\"><img border=\"0\" data-original-src=\"http://forg.co.kr:80/skill/images/uotip/hidden/e_4.gif\" data-recovery=\"missing\" height=\"275\" src=\"/img/placeholder/missing-slot.svg\" style=\"aspect-ratio:300/275\" width=\"300\"></font></p></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"479\">\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font color=\"#636363\" face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\">디싯던전에서 파이어엘리가 \n                            나오는곳에서</font></p>\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font color=\"#636363\" face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\">사진속에 문이 \n                            벽처럼 가려져있습니다.</font></p>\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font color=\"#636363\" face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\">이외에 좌측에도 \n                            있습니다.</font></p>\n</td>\n<td width=\"479\">\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font color=\"#636363\" face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\">아이스던던에있는 \n                            아이스데몬방에손가락이</font></p>\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font color=\"#636363\" face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\">가리키는 벽이 \n                            열 수 있는벽입니다.</font></p>\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font color=\"#636363\" face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\">더블클릭 해주시길.</font></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\">&nbsp;</font>\n</p><table align=\"center\" border=\"\" width=\"60%\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td colspan=\"2\" width=\"606\"> <p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font color=\"#333333\" face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\"><b>미르의 비밀통로</b></font><font color=\"#333333\" face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\"> </font></p></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"479\"><p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\"><img border=\"0\" data-original-src=\"http://forg.co.kr:80/skill/images/uotip/hidden/e_3.gif\" data-recovery=\"missing\" height=\"275\" src=\"/img/placeholder/missing-slot.svg\" style=\"aspect-ratio:300/275\" width=\"300\"></font></p></td>\n<td width=\"479\"><p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\"><img border=\"0\" data-original-src=\"http://forg.co.kr:80/skill/images/uotip/hidden/e_2.gif\" data-recovery=\"missing\" height=\"275\" src=\"/img/placeholder/missing-slot.svg\" style=\"aspect-ratio:300/275\" width=\"300\"></font></p></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"479\"> <p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font color=\"#545454\" face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\">테라산 바론방을 \n                            기점으로해서</font>\n</p><p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font color=\"#545454\" face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\">좌측(west)방향으로 \n                            쭉가시면 사진의지점을</font></p>\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font color=\"#545454\" face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\">발견 하실수 있습니다</font></p>\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font color=\"#545454\" face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\">불밑의제단을 연타로 \n                            더블클릭하던지</font></p>\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font color=\"#545454\" face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\">라스트옵젝키로 \n                            계속 눌러주시면</font></p>\n</td>\n<td width=\"479\"><p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font color=\"#636363\" face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\">스타룸으로 이동됩니다.</font></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\">&nbsp;</font> </p><p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\"><b>Written \n                    By </b></font><font color=\"#666666\" face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\">Forg</font></p>\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\">&nbsp;</font></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td height=\"20\" width=\"627\"><p align=\"right\"><font face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\">&nbsp;<a href=\"/site/skill/uo_knowhow_secret_1/\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"15\" src=\"/img/posts/site/skill/images/left_menu/top.gif\" width=\"50\"></a>&nbsp;</font></p></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table></div>\n"
